        "mp_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Store extras in the refrigerator for up to 3 days. We genuinely prefer this one cold &mdash; there is no reheating step and nothing in it suffers from a night in the fridge except the avocado, which you should slice fresh.</p><p>The tzatziki is the real prize. Keep it up to 4 days and spoon it over any protein or salad you have going; a whole bunch of dill and a spoon of raw honey makes it far more useful than the amount of effort suggests.</p>",
